# SEC-12.1 - trust anchors for api.styliai backend (Railway).
#
# Pinned ROOTS, not leaves. The backend serves a Railway-managed Let's
# Encrypt certificate that renews roughly every 90 days on a schedule we do
# not control and whose next key we cannot know - pinning the leaf or its
# SPKI would brick the app every quarter with no fix faster than an app-store
# review. Roots are long-lived, so this is the pin that survives renewal.
#
# Both anchors below were taken from the live chain on 2026-07-29 and were
# validated by OpenSSL against the system trust store at capture time
# (Verify return code: 0).
#
# Anchor 1 of 2 - CURRENT. ISRG Root X2, terminates today's chain.
#   subject: C=US, O=Internet Security Research Group, CN=ISRG Root X2
